{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45298","headline":"奉同颜使君真卿送李侍御萼赋得荻塘路 · 皎然","name":"奉同颜使君真卿送李侍御萼赋得荻塘路","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落日车遥遥，客心在归路。\n细草暗回塘，春泉萦古渡。\n遗踪叹芜没，远道悲去住。\n寂寞荻花空，行人别无数。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}